{"schema_version":1,"content_id":"demo-a-credential","subject":"邮箱容量预警","body":"尊敬的用户：您的邮箱存储空间已满，系统将于24小时内停用您的账户。请立即点击下方链接登录，并输入您的账号和密码完成验证：http://mail-verify.example-login.top/auth 逾期未验证将永久删除所有邮件。","content_type":"text/plain","sources":[{"sample_id":"demo/A","dataset":"demo","language":"cjk","data_type":"email","variant":"original","category":"credential_phishing","subcategory":"","label":"malicious"}]}
{"schema_version":1,"content_id":"demo-b-maintenance","subject":"系统维护通知","body":"各位同事：本周五晚20:00至22:00进行邮件系统例行维护，期间邮箱可能暂时无法登录，维护结束后自动恢复，无需任何操作。如有疑问请联系信息科。","content_type":"text/plain","sources":[{"sample_id":"demo/B","dataset":"demo","language":"cjk","data_type":"email","variant":"original","category":"maintenance_notice","subcategory":"","label":"benign"}]}
{"schema_version":1,"content_id":"demo-c-giftcard","subject":"在吗","body":"小王，我在开会不方便接电话。你先帮我去买5张京东E卡，每张1000元，买好后把卡号和卡密拍照发到我私人微信，客户那边急用，钱回头给你报销，这事先别跟别人说。","content_type":"text/plain","sources":[{"sample_id":"demo/C","dataset":"demo","language":"cjk","data_type":"email","variant":"original","category":"gift_card_bec","subcategory":"","label":"malicious"}]}
